<title>JORDAN: Jordan's king off to London on private visit.</title>
<headline>Jordan's king off to London on private visit.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>King Hussein of Jordan left on a private visit to London on Friday, the state-run news agency Petra said.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
